A unified productivity application and toolset for developers and power
users, with a strict terminal-inspired dark mode aesthetic: a fast web
interface on top of a standard REST API backend.

# Why

- Stay in the terminal: an API built for integration plus a TUI app, so you
can manage workload without leaving your shell.
- Focus on building, not managing: boards that minimize friction instead of
inviting endless organizing and context switching.

# Shape of the codebase

A Bun monorepo split into apps (web dashboard, TUI, maintenance), backend
services (websocket, webhook, cron, deployer) and a Go SDK, with PostgreSQL
as the store and Docker Compose for local setup.
